There are two completely different forms of luck in Nethack,
RNG luck and luckstone luck.  They need to be dealt with in
very separate ways.

RNG luck - Know how to find out what's cursed and what isn't.
Never use cursed stuff until you know why you want to.  Only
use stuff you've confirmed isn't cursed.  Know how to price
ID items at least to narrow down the options, so you never
end up in a situation where you have some unknown scrolls or
potions and you need to try them out to see if they kill you
or get you out of a fix.  Know monster behavior so you know
when to run and when to fight.  Know carrying limits.

Luckstone luck - Once you find a co-aligned shrine or a
convertable altar without a priest,and once you have the
luckstone from the mines, keep at it until you no longer see
four leafed clovers.  Luckstone luck has a large impact on
combat and plenty of other aspects of the game but it does
nothing to overcome problems like putting on armor that you
don't know is cursed.

To acend - Learn from each death.  Why did you die?  Often the
action that lead to it was several levels above.

